  "flow": {
    "kind": "sequence",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "parse",
        "kind": "call",
        "operation": "parse",
        "arguments": {
          "argv": {
            "ref": "inputs.argv"
          },
          "context": {
            "ref": "inputs.context"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "dispatch",
        "kind": "switch",
        "cases": [
          {
            "id": "help",
            "when": {
              "ref": "steps.parse.outputs.halted"
            },
            "body": {
              "kind": "call",
              "operation": "help",
              "arguments": {
                "help_text": {
                  "ref": "steps.parse.outputs.help_text"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "default": {
          "kind": "sequence",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "prepare",
              "kind": "switch",
              "cases": [
                {
                  "id": "self_test",
                  "when": {
                    "ref": "steps.parse.outputs.args.self_test"
                  },
                  "body": {
                    "kind": "call",
                    "operation": "self_test_inputs",
                    "arguments": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "default": {
                "kind": "call",
                "operation": "load_inputs",
                "arguments": {
                  "args": {
                    "ref": "steps.parse.outputs.args"
                  },
                  "context": {
                    "ref": "inputs.context"
                  }
                }
              },
              "outputs": {
                "intake": {
                  "type": "Intake",
                  "value": {
                    "ref": "selected.outputs.intake"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "normalize",
              "kind": "call",
              "operation": "normalize",
              "arguments": {
                "intake": {
                  "ref": "steps.prepare.outputs.intake"
                }
              },
              "description": "Accumulate objects across concepts first, then detected_packet.objects. For concepts, scan CLASSIFICATION_ORDER and select the first substring-cue match, otherwise boundary_or_regime_assumption. Skip nondictionary detected entries; supplied object_class takes precedence. Unknown classes retain their supplied class and use assumption-profile metadata. Detected concepts use display_name or object_class; examples are stringified, source=detected_pathology. merge carries a dictionary keyed by canonical object_id, retains first metadata, extends concepts/roles; duplicate IDs combine examples using sorted(set(...)). Finally deduplicate/sort concepts and roles, retaining a unique object's original examples, then sort objects high-priority first and by object_id. Return object_count and intake_complete iff objects exist, otherwise no_objects. Each traversal ends at its supplied collection or fixed cue list; no retries, convergence condition, input-size/time cap or exhaustion signal exists. Malformed detected packets/fields and other native exceptions propagate."
            },
            {
              "id": "serialize",
              "kind": "call",
              "operation": "serialize",
              "arguments": {
                "args": {
                  "ref": "steps.parse.outputs.args"
                },
                "packet": {
                  "ref": "steps.normalize.outputs.packet"
                },
                "packet_json": {
                  "ref": "steps.normalize.outputs.packet_json"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "emit",
              "kind": "call",
              "operation": "emit",
              "arguments": {
                "args": {
                  "ref": "steps.parse.outputs.args"
                },
                "text": {
                  "ref": "steps.serialize.outputs.text"
                },
                "context": {
                  "ref": "inputs.context"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "outputs": {
            "packet": {
              "type": "Packet",
              "value": {
                "ref": "steps.normalize.outputs.packet"
              }
            },
            "json_text": {
              "type": "Text",
              "value": {
                "ref": "steps.serialize.outputs.text"
              }
            },
            "exit_code": {
              "type": "ExitCode",
              "value": {
                "ref": "steps.emit.outputs.exit_code"
              }
            },
            "stdout": {
              "type": "Stdout",
              "value": {
                "ref": "steps.emit.outputs.stdout"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "outputs": {
          "packet": {
            "type": "Packet",
            "value": {
              "ref": "selected.outputs.packet"
            }
          },
          "json_text": {
            "type": "Text",
